### MiPoint API Test Collection
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Run: docker-compose up -d first

@base = http://localhost:8000
@customer_direct = http://localhost:8001
@catalog_direct = http://localhost:8002
@booking_direct = http://localhost:8003
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

# ─── Health Checks ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Customer Service health
GET {{customer_direct}}/health

### Space Catalog health
GET {{catalog_direct}}/health

### Booking Service health
GET {{booking_direct}}/health

# ─── Customer Service ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Register cliente
# @name register
POST {{customer_direct}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "rol": "cliente"
}

### 2. Register anfitrión
POST {{customer_direct}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "María García",
  "email": "maria@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "rol": "anfitrion"
}

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{customer_direct}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Get profile
GET {{customer_direct}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update profile
PUT {{customer_direct}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+51999888777",
  "bio": "Organizador de eventos en Lima"
}

# ─── Space Catalog Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Create space (anfitrión token required)
POST {{catalog_direct}}/api/v1/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Salón Miraflores Premium",
  "descripcion": "Salón moderno con capacidad para 80 personas",
  "direccion": "Av. Larco 456",
  "distrito": "Miraflores",
  "capacidad": 80,
  "precio_hora": 150.0,
  "fotos": [
    "https://example.com/foto1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/foto2.jpg"
  ]
}

### 7. Search spaces
GET {{catalog_direct}}/api/v1/spaces?capacidad=50&distrito=Miraflores&precio_max=200

### 8. Get space by ID
GET {{catalog_direct}}/api/v1/spaces/SPACE_ID_HERE

### 9. Activate space (anfitrión)
PUT {{catalog_direct}}/api/v1/spaces/SPACE_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "ACTIVO"
}

# ─── Booking Service ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 10. Create booking
POST {{booking_direct}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "space_id": "SPACE_ID_HERE",
  "anfitrion_id": "ANFITRION_ID_HERE",
  "fecha_inicio": "2026-06-15T14:00:00Z",
  "fecha_fin": "2026-06-15T18:00:00Z",
  "num_personas": 30
}

### 11. Confirm booking (anfitrión token)
PUT {{booking_direct}}/api/v1/bookings/BOOKING_ID_HERE/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nota": "Confirmado. Todo listo para el evento."
}

### 12. Cancel booking
PUT {{booking_direct}}/api/v1/bookings/BOOKING_ID_HERE/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "motivo": "El cliente canceló por problemas de agenda"
}

### 13. Get booking
GET {{booking_direct}}/api/v1/bookings/BOOKING_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Get client bookings
GET {{booking_direct}}/api/v1/bookings/client/CLIENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Via API Gateway (Kong :8000) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. Register via Kong
POST {{base}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Test User",
  "email": "test@kong.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "rol": "cliente"
}

### 16. Search spaces via Kong (no auth needed)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/spaces
